<title>LUXEMBOURG: SOCCER-ISRAEL BEAT LUXEMBOURG 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ISRAEL BEAT LUXEMBOURG 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel beat Luxembourg 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in their World Cup European group five qualifier</p>
<p>on Monday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Itzhaq Zohar 11, Tal Banin 56,</p>
<p>Itzhaq Zohar 80</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,066</p>
<p>    Group five standings    Pl   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Israel			    5   3   1   1   7   4    10</p>
<p> Russia			    4   2   2   0  10   2     8</p>
<p> Bulgaria			  3   2   0   1   6   4     6</p>
<p> Cyprus			    4   1   1   2   4   8     4</p>
<p> Luxembourg			4   0   0   4   1  10     0</p>
<p>Next match: April 2 - Bulgaria v Cyprus</p>
</text>
